{"id":"5ac44a2456ffe30f","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-milnor-link.md","title":"Relative Milnor Residue Package","display":"df-milnor-link — Relative Milnor Residue Package","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-milnor-link","aliases":["58-df-milnor-link"],"display":"df-milnor-link — Relative Milnor Residue Package","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-milnor-link"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-milnor-link</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-milnor-link — Relative Milnor Residue Package"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-knot.md\">../batch05/58-df-knot.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,I,\\bar\\mu,n,\\mu,\\Delta\\in V\">\\(L,I,\\bar\\mu,n,\\mu,\\Delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MilnorInvariant}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MilnorInvariant}_S\\)</span> (Milnor-invariant value relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S(L,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,n,\\operatorname{ran}(L))\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\operatorname{Knot}_S(L(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\to L(i)[S^1]\\cap L(j)[S^1]=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S(L,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,n,\\operatorname{ran}(L))\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\operatorname{Knot}_S(L(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\to L(i)[S^1]\\cap L(j)[S^1]=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}cyclic\\text{-}subsequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S(J,I,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nI\\in n^r\n\\land\\exists m\\in r\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists s\\in r\\;\\exists e\\in r^m\\;\\Bigl(\nJ\\in n^m\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in m\\;(a&lt;b\\to e(a)&lt;e(b))\n\\land\\forall a\\in m\\;J(a)=I((s+e(a))\\bmod r)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}cyclic\\text{-}subsequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S(J,I,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nI\\in n^r\n\\land\\exists m\\in r\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists s\\in r\\;\\exists e\\in r^m\\;\\Bigl(\nJ\\in n^m\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in m\\;(a&lt;b\\to e(a)&lt;e(b))\n\\land\\forall a\\in m\\;J(a)=I((s+e(a))\\bmod r)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}milnor\\text{-}coefficient\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S(\\mu,\\Delta,L,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S(L,n)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal I_n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal I_n=\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}n^r\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal I_n,\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\mathcal I_n,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;\\exists\\mathcal J_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal J_I=\\{J\\in\\mathcal I_n\\mid\n\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S(J,I,n)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\bigl[(\\mathcal J_I=\\varnothing\\land\\Delta(I)=0)\n\\lor(\\mathcal J_I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\Delta(I)=\\gcd\\{\\mu(J)\\mid J\\in\\mathcal J_I\\})\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}milnor\\text{-}coefficient\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S(\\mu,\\Delta,L,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S(L,n)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal I_n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal I_n=\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}n^r\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal I_n,\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\mathcal I_n,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;\\exists\\mathcal J_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal J_I=\\{J\\in\\mathcal I_n\\mid\n\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S(J,I,n)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\bigl[(\\mathcal J_I=\\varnothing\\land\\Delta(I)=0)\n\\lor(\\mathcal J_I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\Delta(I)=\\gcd\\{\\mu(J)\\mid J\\in\\mathcal J_I\\})\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}milnor\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MilnorInvariant}_S(\\bar\\mu,I,L,\\mu,\\Delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S(\\mu,\\Delta,L,n)\n\\land I\\in\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}n^r\n\\land\\bar\\mu=[\\mu(I)]_{\\Delta(I)}\\in\\mathbb Z/\\Delta(I)\\mathbb Z\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}milnor\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MilnorInvariant}_S(\\bar\\mu,I,L,\\mu,\\Delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S(\\mu,\\Delta,L,n)\n\\land I\\in\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}n^r\n\\land\\bar\\mu=[\\mu(I)]_{\\Delta(I)}\\in\\mathbb Z/\\Delta(I)\\mathbb Z\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The component ordering is the index order and each parametrized knot inherits the standard orientation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\">\\(S^1\\)</span>. The link map has the set-valued codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(L)\\)</span> rather than the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, and the empty lower-order family is assigned gcd <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> explicitly.</li>\n<li>This atom formalizes the residue and lower-order-indeterminacy layer relative to a supplied integer coefficient function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>. Constructing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> from preferred longitudes in nilpotent quotients via a Magnus expansion requires a separate peripheral-system atom; the cited abstract link-group atom does not provide that data, so the former false provenance claim has been removed.</li>\n<li>Length-two Milnor invariants recover pairwise linking numbers.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\mu_{123}\">\\(\\bar\\mu_{123}\\)</span> detects the Borromean rings although all pairwise linking numbers vanish.</li>\n<li>Invariants with no repeated index are invariants of link homotopy.</li>\n<li>The residue-class notation records the lower-order indeterminacy; when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_I(L)=0\">\\(\\Delta_I(L)=0\\)</span>, it is an integer.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-knot.md","status":"resolved","id":"ccaaf599ec318a33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,I,\\bar\\mu,n,\\mu,\\Delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MilnorInvariant}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}ordered\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S(L,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,n,\\operatorname{ran}(L))\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\operatorname{Knot}_S(L(i))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\to L(i)[S^1]\\cap L(j)[S^1]=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper\\text{-}cyclic\\text{-}subsequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S(J,I,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nI\\in n^r\n\\land\\exists m\\in r\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists s\\in r\\;\\exists e\\in r^m\\;\\Bigl(\nJ\\in n^m\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in m\\;(a<b\\to e(a)<e(b))\n\\land\\forall a\\in m\\;J(a)=I((s+e(a))\\bmod r)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}milnor\\text{-}coefficient\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S(\\mu,\\Delta,L,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{OrientedOrderedLink}_S(L,n)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal I_n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal I_n=\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}n^r\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal I_n,\\mathbb Z)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\mathcal I_n,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I_n\\;\\exists\\mathcal J_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal J_I=\\{J\\in\\mathcal I_n\\mid\n\\mathrm{ProperCyclicSubsequence}_S(J,I,n)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\bigl[(\\mathcal J_I=\\varnothing\\land\\Delta(I)=0)\n\\lor(\\mathcal J_I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\n\\Delta(I)=\\gcd\\{\\mu(J)\\mid J\\in\\mathcal J_I\\})\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}milnor\\text{-}link}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MilnorInvariant}_S(\\bar\\mu,I,L,\\mu,\\Delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MilnorCoefficientSystem}_S(\\mu,\\Delta,L,n)\n\\land I\\in\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}n^r\n\\land\\bar\\mu=[\\mu(I)]_{\\Delta(I)}\\in\\mathbb Z/\\Delta(I)\\mathbb Z\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"S^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\mu_{123}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_I(L)=0","display":false}],"bytes":3456,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-845","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-milnor-link.md|58-df-milnor-link]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["ccaaf599ec318a33","36d7463d215be751"]}